{"id":"n47395-1-8","stage":4,"title":"더없이 · 无比","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n47395-1-8-1","ko":"김 대리님 승진하셨다면서요. 축하드려요.","zh":"听说金代理升职了啊，恭喜您。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"김","meaning":"金（姓氏）","explanation":"김：金（姓氏）","readings":[{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"대리님","meaning":"代理","explanation":"대리：代理；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"대리","audio":"/audio/4e96b696526850f76e08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48362","senseId":"2","lemma":"대리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"승진하셨다면서요.","meaning":"晋升，升职","explanation":"승진하다：晋升，升职；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서요：引用所听到的陈述，再向对方确认：“听说……，是吗？”","readings":[{"term":"승진하다","audio":"/audio/a21cead08a524ecb0ec4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65642","senseId":"1","lemma":"승진하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"축하드려요.","meaning":"祝贺，庆贺，道贺；(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。","explanation":"축하：祝贺，庆贺，道贺；드리다：(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"축하","audio":"/audio/02fbd137536a81840667.mp3"},{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72137","senseId":"1","lemma":"축하","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"59252","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4e96b696526850f7","term":"대리","zh":"代理","audio":"/audio/4e96b696526850f76e08.mp3","entryId":"48362","definition":"公司中一般职员与课长之间的职位；或位居该职位的人。","pronunciation":["대ː리"]},{"id":"a21cead08a524ecb","term":"승진하다","zh":"晋升，升职","audio":"/audio/a21cead08a524ecb0ec4.mp3","entryId":"65642","definition":"在职场中，升到比现在高的职位。","pronunciation":["승진하다"]},{"id":"02fbd137536a8184","term":"축하","zh":"祝贺，庆贺，道贺","audio":"/audio/02fbd137536a81840667.mp3","entryId":"72137","definition":"对于别人发生的好事开心地表示问候；或指那样的问候。","pronunciation":["추카"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"59252","definition":"(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ca12974b16df260d9833.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n47395-1-8-2","ko":"고마워요. 정말 더없이 기쁩니다.","zh":"谢谢您，我真的高兴极了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고마워요.","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"고맙다：感谢，感激；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"고맙다","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20041","senseId":"1","lemma":"고맙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더없이","meaning":"无比，莫大，非常","explanation":"더없이：无比，莫大，非常","readings":[{"term":"더없이","audio":"/audio/85c22186cfd94b9ce741.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47395","senseId":"1","lemma":"더없이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기쁩니다.","meaning":"高兴，开心","explanation":"기쁘다：高兴，开心；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"기쁘다","audio":"/audio/34ce48b9a78ae52e1c3f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40078","senseId":"1","lemma":"기쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ded2b4943e89f57d","term":"고맙다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3","entryId":"20041","definition":"因别人为自己做了什么，内心感到很满足，并想给予回报。","pronunciation":["고ː맙따"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"85c22186cfd94b9c","term":"더없이","zh":"无比，莫大，非常","audio":"/audio/85c22186cfd94b9ce741.mp3","entryId":"47395","definition":"很满足，再没有期望的。无限地。","pronunciation":["더업씨"]},{"id":"34ce48b9a78ae52e","term":"기쁘다","zh":"高兴，开心","audio":"/audio/34ce48b9a78ae52e1c3f.mp3","entryId":"40078","definition":"心情非常好，十分愉快。","pronunciation":["기쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b66b777fd6ac9f4c31a3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.995,"source":{"url":"https: